{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/go-gh/pulls/325","id":5242604614,"node_id":"PR_kwDOF_MgQc8AAAABOHvMRg","html_url":"https://github.com/cli/go-gh/pull/325","diff_url":"https://github.com/cli/go-gh/pull/325.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cli/go-gh/pull/325.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/go-gh/issues/325","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/go-gh/pulls/325/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/go-gh/pulls/325/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/go-gh/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/go-gh/issues/325/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cli/go-gh/statuses/15fbe1db354aaa7ac0d966e5099f4c0064d4db02","number":325,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix auth token forwarding for hosts with ports","user":{"login":"eeroniemi","id":1384231,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODQyMzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1384231?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi","html_url":"https://github.com/eeroniemi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eeroniemi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Preserve the configured `host:port` authority when matching authorization targets.\n- Forward auth tokens for requests to configured hosts using non-standard ports.\n- Prevent tokens from being sent to the same hostname on a different port.\n- Add regression tests covering matching and mismatched ports.\n\n## Details\n\n`req.URL.Hostname()` omits the port, while `ClientOptions.Host` may include one. As a result, the authorization header was incorrectly omitted when both values referred to the same host and port.\n\nWhen the configured host includes a port, authorization matching now uses the request’s full host authority. API host matching continues to use the hostname-only comparison.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `go test ./pkg/api`\n- `golangci-lint run ./pkg/api/...`","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-10T14:02:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T15:20:00Z","closed_at":"2026-11-10T15:20:00Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7ed50b5b59c745486b54a1fd2febc35ca87eda4f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"BagToad","id":47394200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3Mzk0MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47394200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad","html_url":"https://github.com/BagToad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BagToad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"eeroniemi:auth-token-port","ref":"auth-token-port","repo":{"id":1452706265,"node_id":"R_kgDOVpaJ2Q","name":"go-gh","full_name":"eero